subtract|Instruction checks subtraction direction explicitly: delivery charge is removed from total, not vice versa. Vietnamese preserves the arithmetic relationship and introduces no numeric mismatch.
warehouse|Storage building boundary is supported by both sources; bicycle context does not claim that all warehouses serve retail. Translation and temporal until relation align; noun countability checked.
daisy|Definition uses usually to avoid asserting every named daisy has white petals. Vietnamese distinguishes small wild daisy from an arbitrary chrysanthemum; plural spelling and plant/flower metonymy checked.
flag|Cloth group symbol is not conflated with a warning marker or the verb. Sailing context is original and the Vietnamese raise action agrees with the example without inserting a nation.
licence|Noun permission/document boundary retained, British/American spellings noted without auto-merging identities. The example is fictional and not legal guidance; renewal and market timing align in Vietnamese.
